<%# Endorsements from the Solana ecosystem (public quotes from X).
    Each card links to the original tweet — paste the URL into the `href`
    when you have it. Cards stack on mobile, sit in a 3-column grid on
    desktop, and reuse the existing pixel-card aesthetic. %>
<div class="mb-12">
  <p class="text-center text-purple-300 mb-1" style="font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.12em">
